# ── Wriven .dockerignore (applies to every Dockerfile; render.yaml uses context ".") ─
# Goals: keep build context lean, speed up remote/local builds, and PREVENT baking
# local secrets (.env) or stale artifacts (node_modules, dist) into image layers.

# Version control / metadata
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Dependencies — installed inside the image, never copy host copies
**/node_modules

# Build output — produced inside the image
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.nx

# Secrets — NEVER bake into images. Keep .env.example templates (different name).
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Python caches / venvs
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv

# Tests, coverage, tooling caches (not needed to build/run)
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
**/coverage
**/.eslintcache

# Logs / runtime artifacts
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Render / docs / planning (not needed in image)
render.yaml
render.yml
doc
specs
plans
.claude
